    ],
    "hypotheses": [
      "The pressure and velocity satisfy p_t + K u_x = 0 and u_t + (1/ρ)p_x = 0 [printed page 2, equation (1.5); printed page 3, statement that (1.7) is obtained from (1.5)].",
